WEBVTT

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:02.727
and people go, "Look, it's the Dark Continent."

00:02:02.727 --> 00:02:04.386
Actually, it isn't.

00:02:04.386 --> 00:02:06.415
What it is is a map of innovation.

00:02:06.415 --> 00:02:09.900
And it's really easy to see
where innovation's going on.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:13.960
All the places with lots of electricity, it isn't.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:16.987
(Laughter)

00:02:16.987 --> 00:02:21.520
(Applause)

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.970
And the reason it isn't is because everybody's

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:27.155
watching television or playing Angry Birds.

00:02:27.155 --> 00:02:30.624
(Laughter) (Applause)